    "Injected the native service clock into timestamps, OAuth expiration, idempotency and webhook signatures.",
    "Replaced upstream webhook history with native SQLite records.",
    "Moved OAuth RSA signing identities into native SQLite namespace state for cross-process restoration.",
    "Adjusted UI links and attribution; retained licensed vendor handlers.",
    "Added per-file modification notices and explicit core-source provenance."
  ]
